  "notes": [
    "Snapshots include current local changes, not only committed files.",
    "Metric imports and model data imports are namespaced.",
    "LangFlow process-wide JIT settings are omitted; dataset helper utilities are provided locally.",
    "Training tracking is opt-in and uses environment-based credentials.",
    "Original experiment outputs, checkpoints, caches, virtual environments and credentials are not copied.",
    "LangFlow exposes generator/initial_noise arguments while retaining Euler-EDM updates.",
    "Common generation counts solver intervals, uses per-row seeds, and restores per-module training flags.",
    "New LangFlow Lightning checkpoints store their actual architecture; loaders retain native parameter keys.",
    "LangFlow validation-best and latest periodic checkpoints are saved by separate callbacks.",
    "Training configurations are bundled as package resources and provide a default data-cache directory.",
    "condia.dlm_metrics is a compatibility alias of condila.dlm_metrics, including submodule object identity."
  ],
